---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Flynt Signal — Core Research & Lead Delivery | Flynt AI"
  description="Set your criteria once. Flynt's agents scan 250 million profiles and 30 million companies, scoring every fit and delivering a complete intelligence package to your inbox every day."
>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 1 — HERO
───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="fp-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fp-hero__inner fade-up fade-up-1">
      <div class="tag">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"/><path d="M5 3v4"/><path d="M19 17v4"/><path d="M3 5h4"/><path d="M17 19h4"/></svg>
        Flynt Signal — Core Research &amp; Lead Delivery
      </div>
      <h1 class="fp-hero__headline fade-up fade-up-2">
        Clients you want, found and delivered.<br />Every single day.
      </h1>
      <p class="fp-hero__sub fade-up fade-up-3">
        Set your criteria once. Flynt's agents scan 250 million profiles and 30 million companies finding the exact clients you're targeting, scoring every fit, and delivering a complete intelligence package to your inbox before you open your laptop.
      </p>
      <div class="fp-hero__ctas fade-up fade-up-4">
        <a href="https://app.tryflynt.ai/" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" style="background:var(--black);border-color:var(--black);">Start Free Trial →</a>
        <button class="btn btn--outline btn--lg" data-demo-trigger>See It In Action →</button>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-trust fade-up fade-up-4">
        <span>✓ 250M+ profiles</span>
        <span class="fp-trust__dot">·</span>
        <span>✓ 30M+ companies</span>
        <span class="fp-trust__dot">·</span>
        <span>✓ 30 leads/day per agent</span>
        <span class="fp-trust__dot">·</span>
        <span>✓ 5 min set up time</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 2 — THE TIME YOU GET BACK
───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section fp-time-section">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="fp-time-header">
      <div class="fp-time-header__left">
        <div class="tag" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          The Time You Get Back
        </div>
        <h2>This used to take 4 hours.<br />Now it takes <span style="color: var(--purple); -webkit-text-stroke: 0.6px var(--purple);">zero</span>.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-time-header__right">
        <p>Every piece of intelligence in your lead package would need four separate tools and a full morning of research to gather manually. Flynt does it overnight.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fp-time-compare">

      <!-- WITHOUT FLYNT -->
      <div class="fp-time-col fp-time-col--without">
        <div class="fp-time-col-header">
          <span class="fp-time-dot fp-time-dot--off"></span>
          <span class="fp-time-col-label">Without Flynt</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="fp-time-list">
          <li>
            <div class="fp-time-tool">
              <div class="fp-time-tool-icon">in</div>
              <div>
                <div class="fp-time-tool-name">LinkedIn Sales Navigator</div>
                <div class="fp-time-tool-sub">Hiring patterns · leadership changes</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="fp-time-badge">60 min</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="fp-time-tool">
              <div class="fp-time-tool-icon">CB</div>
              <div>
                <div class="fp-time-tool-name">Crunchbase Pro</div>
                <div class="fp-time-tool-sub">Funding rounds · company data</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="fp-time-badge">30 min</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="fp-time-tool">
              <div class="fp-time-tool-icon">G</div>
              <div>
                <div class="fp-time-tool-name">Google Alerts</div>
                <div class="fp-time-tool-sub">Contract wins · company news</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="fp-time-badge">30 min</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="fp-time-tool">
              <div class="fp-time-tool-icon">JB</div>
              <div>
                <div class="fp-time-tool-name">Job Boards</div>
                <div class="fp-time-tool-sub">Burst hiring · open role tracking</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="fp-time-badge">60 min</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="fp-time-tool">
              <div class="fp-time-tool-icon">
                <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 3a2.828 2.828 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="fp-time-tool-name">Manual outreach research</div>
                <div class="fp-time-tool-sub">Writing personalisation angles per lead</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="fp-time-badge">60 min</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="fp-time-total fp-time-total--without">
          <span class="fp-time-total-label">Daily Total</span>
          <div class="fp-time-total-right">
            <span class="fp-time-total-num">4 hrs</span>
            <div class="fp-time-total-sub">before your first call</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- VS -->
      <div class="fp-time-vs" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="fp-time-vs-btn">VS</div>
      </div>

      <!-- WITH FLYNT -->
      <div class="fp-time-col fp-time-col--with">
        <div class="fp-time-col-header">
          <span class="fp-time-dot fp-time-dot--on"></span>
          <span class="fp-time-col-label">With Flynt</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="fp-time-leads">
          <li>
            <div class="fp-time-score">99%</div>
            <div>
              <div class="fp-time-lead-name">Meridian Capital</div>
              <div class="fp-time-lead-meta"><span class="fp-time-signal">Burst hire</span> · 4 data roles · 18 days · sarah@meridian.com</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="fp-time-score">94%</div>
            <div>
              <div class="fp-time-lead-name">Veritas Growth</div>
              <div class="fp-time-lead-meta"><span class="fp-time-signal">Funding</span> · Series B $22M · james@veritas.io</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="fp-time-score">91%</div>
            <div>
              <div class="fp-time-lead-name">Athos Consulting</div>
              <div class="fp-time-lead-meta"><span class="fp-time-signal">Leadership</span> · New CTO joined 3 weeks ago</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="fp-time-score">88%</div>
            <div>
              <div class="fp-time-lead-name">Nova Systems</div>
              <div class="fp-time-lead-meta"><span class="fp-time-signal">Contract win</span> · £4M gov contract · AI hooks ready</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="fp-time-lead--muted">
            <div class="fp-time-score fp-time-score--muted">···</div>
            <div>
              <div class="fp-time-lead-name fp-time-lead-name--muted">More leads waiting</div>
              <div class="fp-time-lead-meta">Delivered before 9am</div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="fp-time-total fp-time-total--with">
          <span class="fp-time-total-label">Daily Total</span>
          <div class="fp-time-total-right">
            <span class="fp-time-total-num fp-time-total-num--accent">0 min</span>
            <div class="fp-time-total-sub fp-time-total-sub--accent">runs overnight while you sleep</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- STAT CARDS -->
    <div class="fp-time-stats">
      <div class="fp-time-stat">
        <div class="fp-time-stat-num fp-time-stat-num--accent">4 hrs</div>
        <div class="fp-time-stat-title">Back every morning</div>
        <div class="fp-time-stat-desc">Spend your time on calls, not research.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-time-stat">
        <div class="fp-time-stat-num">4 → 1</div>
        <div class="fp-time-stat-title">Tools replaced</div>
        <div class="fp-time-stat-desc">LinkedIn, Crunchbase, Alerts, and job boards — in one agent.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-time-stat">
        <div class="fp-time-stat-num fp-time-stat-num--accent">$500<sup>+</sup></div>
        <div class="fp-time-stat-title">Saved per month</div>
        <div class="fp-time-stat-desc">vs. paying for each tool separately.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 3 — BEFORE / AFTER
───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section new-shift">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="new-shift__header">
      <div class="new-shift__header-left">
        <div class="tag">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
          Before &amp; After
        </div>
        <h2 class="new-shift__headline">Hours of research every day. <span class="new-shift__accent">Or none at all.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="new-shift__header-right">
        <p class="new-shift__lead">This is how most recruiters find clients. And this is how Flynt changes it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="new-shift__compare">

      <div class="new-shift__card new-shift__card--old">
        <div class="ns-badge ns-badge--old">
          <span class="ns-badge-icon ns-badge-icon--x">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          The Old Way
        </div>
        <h3 class="ns-card-title">"The pipeline stalls every time you do."</h3>
        <hr class="ns-divider" />
        <ul class="ns-list ns-list--old">
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            Open 8 tabs. Start researching. Data is already stale.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            30 minutes just to find one personalisation angle.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            Two hours in. You haven't made a single call.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            Land a placement. Stop prospecting. Pipeline goes quiet.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--x"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span>
            Monday morning. Start over.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="new-shift__shift-col" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="new-shift__shift-btn">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <span class="new-shift__shift-label">The Shift</span>
      </div>

      <div class="new-shift__card new-shift__card--new">
        <div class="ns-badge ns-badge--new">
          <span class="ns-badge-icon ns-badge-icon--check">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          The Flynt Way
        </div>
        <h3 class="ns-card-title">"From signal to ready-to-send before you open your laptop."</h3>
        <hr class="ns-divider" />
        <ul class="ns-list ns-list--new">
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            30 scored, matched leads waiting every morning.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Decision-maker contacts, fit scores, and AI hooks already written.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Open your leads. Start your calls. Zero research required.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Land a placement. Pipeline keeps filling automatically.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ns-item-icon ns-item-icon--check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Monday morning. 30 new leads already in your inbox.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="new-shift__close">
      <div class="new-shift__close-divider">
        <span class="new-shift__close-line"></span>
        <div class="new-shift__close-icon">
          <img src="/images/logo-mark.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28" />
        </div>
        <span class="new-shift__close-line new-shift__close-line--right"></span>
      </div>
      <p>This is what BD looks like without Flynt. And with it.</p>
      <strong class="new-shift__close-headline">The difference between struggling to find clients and having them flow consistently isn't effort, it's whether you have an <span class="new-shift__accent">engine running behind you.</span></strong>
    </div>
    <div class="new-shift__spacer"></div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 4 — CONFIGURATION (dark)
───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="positioning fp-config">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fp-config__header">
      <div class="tag fp-dark-tag">One Setup</div>
      <h2 class="fp-dark-h2">One setup. Runs <span style="color: #dbb6f8; -webkit-text-stroke: 0;">forever.</span></h2>
      <p class="fp-dark-sub">Under 5 minutes to configure. Fresh leads every day after that.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fp-steps">
      <div class="fp-step">
        <div class="fp-step__num">01</div>
        <h3 class="fp-step__title">Define Your Market</h3>
        <p class="fp-step__body">Pick your target industries, job titles, company size, and geography. Flynt builds its search logic around your exact criteria.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-step">
        <div class="fp-step__num">02</div>
        <h3 class="fp-step__title">Your Agent Activates</h3>
        <p class="fp-step__body">Your AI agent runs in the background — scanning for companies actively hiring, finding the right decision-makers, and building an intelligence package on each one. Automatically.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-step">
        <div class="fp-step__num">03</div>
        <h3 class="fp-step__title">Leads Land Everyday</h3>
        <p class="fp-step__body">Before you open your laptop, a fresh list of scored, matched, and personalised leads is already waiting. Every single day. All you do is show up.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 4 — INTELLIGENCE PACKAGE
───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section fp-intel">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header section-header--center">
      <div class="tag" style="margin: 0 auto 16px;">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/></svg>
        The Intelligence Package
      </div>
      <h2>Every lead arrives <span style="color: var(--purple); -webkit-text-stroke: 0.6px var(--purple);">ready to action.</span></h2>
      <p style="max-width: 780px;">Everything you need to reach out with confidence. No extra research required.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fp-cards">
      <div class="fp-card">
        <h3 class="fp-card__title">Match Score</h3>
        <p class="fp-card__desc">A percentage match against your criteria — with a written breakdown of exactly why this lead qualifies.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-card">
        <h3 class="fp-card__title">Decision-Maker Contact</h3>
        <p class="fp-card__desc">Name, job title, direct email, LinkedIn, and timezone. Everything in one place, ready to go.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-card">
        <h3 class="fp-card__title">Company Context</h3>
        <p class="fp-card__desc">Industry, size, background, and a direct link to the live job posting that triggered the match.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-card">
        <h3 class="fp-card__title">Fit Score Breakdown</h3>
        <p class="fp-card__desc">See exactly which criteria were met — role, location, seniority, company size, and funding status.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-card">
        <h3 class="fp-card__title">Recent Company Signals</h3>
        <p class="fp-card__desc">News, funding rounds, leadership changes, and partnerships — surfaced as personalisation context.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-card">
        <h3 class="fp-card__title">AI Personalization Hooks</h3>
        <p class="fp-card__desc">AI-written angles pulled from the company, the contact, recent news, and the job posting. Drop straight into your outreach.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 5 — MATCH SCORING
───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section fp-scoring" style="background: var(--slate-50);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fp-scoring__header">
      <div class="fp-scoring__header-left">
        <div class="tag">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          Match Scoring
        </div>
        <h2>Stop guessing who's worth your time. <span style="color: var(--purple); -webkit-text-stroke: 0.6px var(--purple);">The score</span> tells you.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-scoring__header-right">
        <p>Every lead arrives with a percentage match and a written breakdown of exactly why it qualifies or where it falls short. In seconds, you know which leads to prioritize and which to skip.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fp-score">
      <div class="fp-score__left">
        <ul class="fp-score__list">
          <li>
            <span class="fp-score__check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            <span><strong>Role match</strong> — Does the active job posting match your target title?</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fp-score__check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            <span><strong>Hiring manager location</strong> — Is the decision-maker in your target geography?</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fp-score__check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            <span><strong>Hiring manager seniority</strong> — Do they have the authority to hire a recruiter?</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fp-score__check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            <span><strong>Company size</strong> — Does headcount fall within your defined range?</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fp-score__check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            <span><strong>Recently funded</strong> — Has the company raised funding signalling an active budget?</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fp-score__check"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            <span><strong>Company industry</strong> — Does the sector align with your target market?</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-score__right">
        <div class="fp-callout">
          <div class="fp-callout__score">99% Match</div>
          <p class="fp-callout__name">Athena Yasaman, Director of Business Operations at Suno.</p>
          <p class="fp-callout__reason">Senior Graphic Designer role fully matches target title. New York location aligns. Series D funding confirms active hiring budget. All criteria satisfied.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 6 — AI PERSONALIZATION HOOKS
───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section fp-hooks-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header section-header--center">
      <h2>A <span style="color: var(--purple); -webkit-text-stroke: 0.6px var(--purple);">unique hook</span> for every lead. Stand out in every inbox.</h2>
      <p style="max-width: none;">Generic outreach gets ignored. Flynt writes a personalised angle for every lead – pulled from real signals about the company, the person, and the job.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fp-hooks">
      <div class="fp-hook-card">
        <h3 class="fp-hook-card__title">Company Hook</h3>
